  "labels": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "status": "official",
      "text": "section 911(b)(2)(D). The exclusion amount: $80,000 for the 2005 statutory base year ((D)(i)); $130,000 for 2025 (Rev. Proc. 2024-40 section 2.39) and $132,900 for 2026 (Rev. Proc. 2025-32 section 4.39) under the (D)(ii) inflation adjustment. Other years are gaps, not zeros."
    }
  ],
